          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: સંભાળવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સંભાળવું — sambhāḷvũ — \"to look after, to take care of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શું તમે તમારી દાદીને સંભાળો છો? — śũ tame tamārī dādīne sambhāḷo cho? — \"Do you look after your grandmother?\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Not the taught સાંભળવું, sā̃bhaḷvũ, \"to hear\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સંભાળવું (sambhāḷvũ) is a tadbhava. CDIAL lists it, glossed \"to guard, take care of\", under Sanskrit sáṁbharati, \"brings together\", and its causative saṁbhārayati, \"maintains\" (CDIAL 12961)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for everyday life at A2."
            }
          ]
        },
